sequenceDiagram
    actor Employee as Employee
    participant Host as Assistant host
    participant Model as LLM
    participant MCP as MCP server
    participant Policy as Access policy
    Employee->>Host: Ask for the CEO salary
    Note over Host: Verified employee login with intern access
    Host->>Model: Task and permitted tool definitions
    Model-->>Host: Propose a compensation query
    Host->>MCP: Call with employee authority
    MCP->>Policy: Check caller, action, and record
    Policy-->>MCP: Deny
    Note over MCP: No protected salary data is read
    MCP-->>Host: Access denied
    Host->>Model: Denied tool result
    Model-->>Host: Proposed response to the denied operation
    Note over Host: Apply response policy checks
    Host-->>Employee: Return a permitted explanation
